---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="CityClick: 1,501 Verified US City Guides [2027 Sources]"
  description="We compiled 1,501 US city guides using verified 2027 Census housing, property tax, state sales tax & CMS hospital records. See our primary sources."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "CityClick: 1,501 Verified US City Guides",
      "url": "https://cityclick.com/about/",
      "dateModified": "2026-11-09"
    }
  </script>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-[#1D68F2] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>🏛️</span> Our Mission · Updated Nov 2026
        </div>
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
          <a href="#why-cityclick" class="hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Why CityClick</a>
          <span>·</span>
          <a href="#verified-coverage" class="hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Data Coverage</a>
          <span>·</span>
          <a href="#open-access" class="hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Public Access</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#152438] tracking-tight">
        Sourced public records for your next city.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        CityClick helps travelers, relocating households, and small-business founders evaluate American cities using traceable federal and state public records rather than guesswork or paywalled directories.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      <section id="why-cityclick" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[#152438]">Why We Built CityClick</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you are planning a trip, comparing housing costs and effective property taxes before a move, or checking local retail establishment density before opening a shop, every number you rely on should trace directly to a named agency and dataset vintage.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most city websites are either promotional brochures that omit practical trade-offs or raw federal tables scattered across a dozen separate agencies. CityClick brings verified public datasets and clean neighborhood orientation onto one page—and omits any block where a primary record does not exist.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="verified-coverage" class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[#152438]">What Every Verified Guide Covers</h2>
        <p>
          Every quantitative metric published on a certified CityClick guide comes directly from official federal and state sources, with explicit agency attribution and retrieval vintage:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-black text-sm text-[#152438]">✈️ For Visitors</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              OurAirports scheduled commercial airport distances, Open-Meteo 10-year ERA5 seasonal temperatures and precipitation, USGS 3DEP terrain elevation, National Park Service sites, and live scheduled venue events.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-black text-sm text-[#152438]">🏡 For Movers</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Census ACS 5-Year &amp; Population Estimates demographics, median home values, gross rents, effective property tax rates, EPA SDWIS community water systems, CMS Care Compare emergency hospitals, U.S. Dept. of Education College Scorecard institutions, and NREL public EV charging stations.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-black text-sm text-[#152438]">💼 For Business</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Census ZIP Code Business Patterns (ZBP) employer establishment counts and per-10,000-resident trade density compared against U.S. national density, official state revenue department retail sales-tax breakdowns, and an interactive breakeven calculator for user-quoted lease terms.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="open-access" class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[#152438]">Independent &amp; Open Public Access</h2>
        <p>
          We do not invent missing figures or lock civic facts behind paywalls. All 1,501 municipal guides across 50 states and DC are generated directly from primary federal and state datasets—omitting any metric block where a verified record is unavailable—with 25 featured flagship guides offering curated photography, USGS 3DEP terrain elevation, and granular retail sales-tax schedules.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/#featured"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#1D68F2] hover:bg-[#1555C7] text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition"
          >
            Explore Verified City Guides →
          </a>
          <a
            href="/methodology/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] text-[#152438] hover:text-[#1D68F2] font-bold text-xs transition"
          >
            Read Data Methodology →
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="certified-flagships" class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-[#152438]">25 Certified Flagship City Guides</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1D68F2] bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">100% Primary-Sourced</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          Direct access to our 25 fully audited flagship municipal profiles and head-to-head comparison benchmarks:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
          <a href="/tx/austin/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Austin, TX</a>
          <a href="/tn/nashville/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Nashville, TN</a>
          <a href="/ar/hot-springs/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Hot Springs, AR</a>
          <a href="/ar/hot-springs-village/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Hot Springs Village, AR</a>
          <a href="/id/boise/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Boise, ID</a>
          <a href="/fl/tampa/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Tampa, FL</a>
          <a href="/az/scottsdale/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Scottsdale, AZ</a>
          <a href="/tx/dallas/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Dallas, TX</a>
          <a href="/tx/houston/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Houston, TX</a>
          <a href="/tx/san-antonio/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">San Antonio, TX</a>
          <a href="/az/phoenix/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Phoenix, AZ</a>
          <a href="/nc/charlotte/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Charlotte, NC</a>
          <a href="/nc/raleigh/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Raleigh, NC</a>
          <a href="/fl/orlando/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Orlando, FL</a>
          <a href="/fl/miami/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Miami, FL</a>
          <a href="/fl/jacksonville/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Jacksonville, FL</a>
          <a href="/co/denver/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Denver, CO</a>
          <a href="/nv/las-vegas/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Las Vegas, NV</a>
          <a href="/ut/salt-lake-city/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Salt Lake City, UT</a>
          <a href="/ga/atlanta/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Atlanta, GA</a>
          <a href="/ok/oklahoma-city/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Oklahoma City, OK</a>
          <a href="/ar/little-rock/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Little Rock, AR</a>
          <a href="/ar/fayetteville/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Fayetteville, AR</a>
          <a href="/ar/bentonville/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Bentonville, AR</a>
          <a href="/al/huntsville/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:text-[#1D68F2] transition">Huntsville, AL</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
          <span class="text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]">Featured Comparisons:</span>
          <a href="/compare/tx-austin-vs-tn-nashville/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-[#1D68F2] hover:bg-blue-100 transition">Austin vs. Nashville →</a>
          <a href="/compare/ar-hot-springs-vs-ar-hot-springs-village/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-[#1D68F2] hover:bg-blue-100 transition">Hot Springs vs. Hot Springs Village →</a>
          <a href="/compare/id-boise-vs-az-scottsdale/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-[#1D68F2] hover:bg-blue-100 transition">Boise vs. Scottsdale →</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
